OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum charity's 30 years of
OL,4,Ahelping people
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have more in common than that which
OL,7,Fdivides us."
OL,9,FFor the past three decades, Asylum
OL,10,FWelcome has offered advice and support
OL,11,Fto asylum seekers, refugees and
OL,12,Fvulnerable migrants across Oxfordshire.
OL,14,FIn that time, the topic of migration -
OL,15,Fincluding that of asylum seekers,
OL,16,Frefugees - has become a political
OL,17,Ffootball which regularly dominates the
OL,18,Fnational agenda.
